<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Te</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh ɓi Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh ɓi Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kaɗaŋ Pool koc ŋ kur kaŋ Tessalonik,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">Tum ci 17:1-9</ref></char></note> wa nikee ŋ ɗooƴ ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka kanakɗoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:40-18:22">Tum ci 15:40–18:22</ref></char></note> A yegɗohha <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> nga, te wa raakka ɓi kos, waaye a arra aañu ne a pul kur ka. Wa jaahiɗta ɗe lool, findi ɓooɓa han kos na hee moocohe. Weɗ tah, wa a nik ŋ Ateen,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15-18:1">Tum ci 17:15–18:1</ref></char></note> a woossa Timoote ne a kaɗ marka findi ɓa nikoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:1-2">1 Tessalonik 3:1-2</ref></char></note> Ƴutta, a yi Pool, a taalndiɗta Korenta. Timoote hunnda na Silweng a kaɗta marka ɓi Tessalonik, te a wiirukka na yegɗoh neɓiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:6">1 Tessalonik 3:6</ref></char></note> Ɓa raakka Pool ŋ Korenta.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Tum ci 18:5</ref></char></note> Weɗ Pool fiisoh ɓi Tessalonik kaɓɗohiŋ ɗe koc.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wa mand haa ne Timoote dokkiɗ Tessalonik na fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh, a nikka nga ƴissuut. Ƴutta a pulohha Tessalonik a wiirukka na yegɗoh neɓiɗ. Pool sumissa ŋ kosaŋ ɓi Tessalonik<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-4">2 Tessalonik 1:3-4</ref></char></note> waaye a hotta ne wa baahiɗ ne a ñiiniɗ ɓi in.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-3">2 Tessalonik 2:1-3</ref></char></note> Teemb ndeem, a fiissa ɓa kaɓɗohi kanakɗoh wii.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh ɓi Tessalonik kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool kañɗiɗ ɓi Tessalonik te a corkiɗiɗ Kooh nga ɓa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-12">1:1-12</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">- Ñiinɗiŋ in ci kaɗ ngaŋ hayisiŋ Yeesu na hultiŋ kosiɗ ci kaan <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-12">2:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ndeng ngaŋ kosi <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:13-17">2:13-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool nakiɗ ɓi Tessalonik kiimɗu Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-5">3:1-5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Njirñiŋ panguk <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:6-15">3:6-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-17">3:16-17</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Mi yii kañiɗ ɗu, ɗu ɓi Janguuniŋ Tessalonik. Mi, Pool, na Silweng na Timoote, ɓoo ɓii kañiɗ ɗu, ɗu ɓi nik ŋ Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo, ɗu nikka ŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> Heɗi. <verse eid="2TH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Kooh Baabi na Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi baahohaat ɗu, on ɗu jam.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool corkiɗiɗ ɓi Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Ɓaah ci, ɓoo joyiɗ gen corkiɗee Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗu, te wa waas ne ɓoo tuma. Kosiŋ ɗu wii ɓaatuk keeh-keeh, te ɗu jen, yaa nu nga ɗah, waaɗi a waaɗ morom ce na uupe uup ɓaatuk. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Ineem weɗ tah ɓoo na woye ɓi Janguuciŋ Kooh ne ɓoo neɓuuɗ nga ɗu, sagu muñi ɗu na muñe na kosi ɗu raak ŋ ɗooƴ tolfiɗ ci na miskiɗ ciŋ ɗu jen.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Miskiɗ ceem na teeɓohe ne findi Kooh na atte'ohe, wa ɗaa ; ca na onee ɗu ne ɗu yeyyoo Nguuriŋ ɗe, Nguuri tah ɗu muñee miskiɗ. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Wa in yurhiɗ ŋ has ciŋ ɗe ne a deg miskiɗ ɓi na degee ɗu miskiɗ, <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>te a iɗsiɗ ɗu, na ɓoo jen, ŋ miskiɗ ceem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:7">Ineem raakan ŋ mbehi Yeesu Heɗi teeɓohkan, a pulohan Eel ci, a hun na malaakaaciŋ ɗe, ca raakiɗ hatil keeh-keeh. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>A hey haye ŋ ɗooƴ jaal yongkaah, a mbugal ɓi inahɗi Kooh te ɓa sannga taambiɗ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> kaɗ ŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Mbugaliŋ ɓa nikan ne ɓa ɗumbu po faw, ɓa us Heɗi na yaki hatiliŋ ɗe yak. <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>A hey haye ŋ mbeheem ne hooliɗ ciŋ ɗe yakiɗ ɗe, te ɓi kos ɗe jen hey feyse ŋ yaki a yak. Te ɗu, ɗu hey ɓaahe nga, laam ɗu kosiɗ ini ɓoo seede ŋ fikiiɗu.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Ineem weɗ tah ɓoo na genee ɗu kiimiɗ Koohiŋ ɓoo, ne a on ɗu ɗu yeyyoo ɓeeɗki a ɓeeɗuk ɗu. Te na hatiliŋ ɗe, a on ɗu, ɗu mitiɗ in baahiɗ nu ɗu waaɗ tum ɗah, ɗu mitiɗ pangki ɗu na tume sagu kosi ɗu kos. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Ŋ ineem, ɗu hey teeɓohe findi tiikiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu yakoh, a nam ɗu yakiɗ ŋ niki ɗu nik nga ɗe ; wa nik baahohiŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, yi Koohiŋ ɓoo na Heɗ ɓoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"baahohiŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, yi Koohiŋ ɓoo na Heɗ ɓoo" ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min toksu "baahohiŋ Koohiŋ ɓoo na Heɗi Yeesu Kiristaa".</char></note>.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ini adgan hayiŋ Heɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ hayiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, na nangɗukohiŋ ɓoo ŋ serooce, ɓoo na kiimee ɗu inii, ɓaah ci : <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Ɓo' hay nga ɗu, woyee ɗu ne mbehiŋ Heɗi hayiɗ po cootiɗ ɗah, kinaat gaaw jaahiɗ, kinaat mbet fit ciŋ ɗu. Ali ɓa woo ne wa puloh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>, wala nga ɓoo, wala ŋ fiis ci ɓoo kaɓɗoh sah, <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>ɓa kinaat ɗu muuƴiɗ ŋ in nu wa min nikoh ɗah.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 2:3">Mbeheem hayanɗi muk feeh laayiɗ faɗɗi kos Kooh ɗah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"feeh laayiɗ faɗɗi kos Kooh ɗah" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min toksu "feeh ɓi Adina kaɗɗi po ɓa sang kikilifaakiŋ Kooh".</char></note> ; na feeh Ɓoyi Baahaaɗiini, hotukɗi ɗah. Ɓoyeem mirndohan ɗumbu. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>A hey sange Kooh na in ci na woyse kooh jen na in nu na ñaamkasse ɗah, a hey dege haf ce ŋ ɗafuk in ceem jen, a hey kee po a yi ŋ haf ce, a ɓoof ŋ kahnaŋ Kooh, a woo ne a yi Kooh. <verse eid="2TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Naandsukaat ŋ woyeen ɗu ineem wa ŋ nik na ɗu !<verse eid="2TH 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Ɗu inhiɗ ini amb ɗe ɗiski wa nik po a minanɗi teeɓohuk feeh jamanooniŋ ɗe reeɗi ɗah. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Ɗiski wa nik, kibaahaaɗi wa ɗii panguk ŋ kumpa. Sekaat po yi amb Ɓoyi Baahaaɗiini coot rek ! <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Teemb ndeem, Ɓoyi Baahaaɗiini hey hotke, ŋ mirndaani Yeesu Heɗi hey ɗe fuuɗse, a kaan. Siñaarɗiŋ hayiŋ ɗe dong weɗ na hee ɗumbe ɓoyeem.<verse eid="2TH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Ɓoyi Baahaaɗiineem hayee ɗah, wa hunan na hatiliŋ Seytaani, wa hunan na keemaan nu nik, na firnde na in feyohiɗ ne a ñaañoh ɓooɓi. <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>A hey haɓɗe in moɗaaɗi nu nik ne a ñaañoh ɓi nik ŋ kot muuƴ sagu teyɗukaaɗi waaɗ keeh ki joyee ɓa muciɗ. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Weɗ tah, Kooh woosoh ɓa ini muuƴɗan ɓa, ne ɓa kos lee, <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>ŋ ineem, ɓi kosɗi keeh ki jen te ɓa neɓuusa ŋ ini lahɗi waas, ɓa hey atte'se.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndeng ngaŋ kosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Waaye, ɓaah ci, ɗu ɓii Heɗi keeñkoh, ɓoo joyiɗ gen corkiɗ Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗu. Ɓoo joyiɗ ɗe corkiɗ ŋ kooɗi a kooɗ ɗu findi nguɗiŋ tohri koc ne ɗu mucɗu taamboh ŋ hoolɗi <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> hooliɗ ɗu wuu Kooh na kosi ɗu kos keeh ki. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>A waaɗee ne ɗu rahas ineem, weɗ tah a ɓeeɗukka ɗu taamboh ŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ɓoo woyee ɗu, ne ɗu min ɓaah ŋ yaki Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa yak. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Kon, ɓaah ci, ndengaat, te ɗu amb baahiɗ in ci ɗu jangɗu, te ɗu rahassa ca, wa nik ci ɓoo woo wala ci ɓoo fiis, kaɓɗohha ca.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa ŋ haf ce na Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo, yi waaɗ ɓoo po a baahohha ɓoo ñaahi a na ñaahe ɓoo ne ɓoo ndengɗuk te wa gen gen, na oolki baahiɗi ɓoo raak ŋ in ci na haye, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>a ñaahaat ɗu, a ndengiɗ ɗu ŋ tumohaaɗ baahiɗ nu nik na woo baahiɗ nu nik !<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kooh cariɗ oolku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ini tas weɗ ne ɗu kiimiɗ ɓoo Kooh ne woo kiŋ Heɗi min pasarkoh baahiɗ te wa yakɗu ŋ ɗisik laayiɗ findi wa yakɗohu ŋ ɗiskiŋ ɗu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Kiimaat Kooh ne ɓoo muc ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓo' ci añaandiɗ ci, baahaaɗiici ; e ɓooɓi jen raak kos haa. <verse eid="2TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Waaye Heɗi cariɗ oolku : A hey ɗu ndengɗe, a niiɗ ɗu ŋ baahaaɗiini. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Wa hooliɗ ɓoo ŋ niki ɓoo nik nga ɗe ne ɗu na tume ini ɓoo nak ɗu te ɗu heya gene tum.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Heɗi yurhiɗaat keeñ ciŋ ɗu ŋ waaɗi Kooh waaɗ ɗu na muñi nik ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Njirñiŋ panguk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Ɓaah ci, ɓoo na nakee ɗu ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi Yeesu Kiristaa, ne ɗu us ɓaah nu na pese pes palañsukohiɗ ɗah. Laam, ɓaah mand ɗaa pesohɗi jangɗohi a rahsoh nga ɓoo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Ɗu inhiɗ ŋ haf ɗu findi ɗu joy ɓoo altiɗkohoh, laam wi ɓoo nik na ɗu ɓoo peseeɗi pes palañsukohiɗ. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Ɓoo ñamɗi ali kañam ɓo' wi ɓoo wirindɗi. Ɓoo pangkee panguk, ɓoo raakeeɗa miskiɗ wek na noh ne ɓoo gaƴkuu ŋ ali ɓo' nga ɗu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Wa nikɗi haa ne waas oneeɗi ɓoo ne ɓoo meeksoh in, waaye e ɓoo waaɗee ɗu teeɓ findi ɗu altiɗkohan ɓoo. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Wa ɓoo nik na ɗu, ɓoo eɗee ɗu nakohii : Ɓo' sang panguk ɗah, a kinaat ñam !<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Ɓoo kerhiɗ ne raakiɗ ɓi ɓo' nga ɗu ɓi na pese pes palañsukohiɗ, ɓa na pangkeeɗi, ɓa na gene aas ŋ in ci ɓa rahsohɗi. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Ɓoo ɓii woo ɓooɓeem te ɓoo ɓii ñaah ɓa ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi Yeesu Kiristaa ne ɓa pangkaat moɗoɗ, ɓa ñam kañam ki ɓa raakoot.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo, ini kaɗ nga ɗu nak, kinaat moos yaaɓoh ŋ tum baahiɗ. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Ɓo' sang taambiɗ ini ɓoo woo ŋ fiisi ɓoo na kaɓɗohee ɗu wii ɗah, inhisaat ɗe baahiɗ te kinaat ɗe ɓaahndohis ŋ ali in, ne a kaci. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Kinaat ɗe amb findi sangiɗiŋ ɗu, waaye woytohaat ɗe findi ɓaah ɗu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Heɗi ŋ haf ce, yi Heɗ jam, onaat ɗu jam ŋ in nu nik, na findi wa min mand ɗah. A nikaat na ɗu jen !<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>
    <char style="sig">Mi Pool, ñam fiisoot kañɗohii na yaahiŋ ngo. Weɗ mandargaaniŋ ngo ŋ fiis ci mi na kaɓɗohe jen ; fiisohaaɗiŋ ngo weɗi weem.</char> <verse eid="2TH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/><char style="sig">Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa baahohaat ɗu jen !</char><verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
